      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLAZING CASH (1) jumps from the inside draw. Latest effort finished 6th over 365m at Nowra beaten 3.5 lengths (21.46) behind Topper Tenacious in a Grade 5 on July 29. Looks suited and should go close. DYNAMIC ARCHER (6) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, most recently finishing 3rd at Richmond over 320m. Will give a great sight again. TINY MAC (2) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at Wagga over 320m (19.11). The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. SPUNKY MONKEY (8) deserves plenty of thought over this distance.",
